msgid "SoC refinement and physical acceptance"
msgstr "SoC 完善与物理验收"

msgid ""
"Nexus maintains exact silicon mechanisms. SoC facts and routes, private "
"provider implementations, generated static instances, Board connections and "
"observed physical behavior have separate responsibilities. The existing "
"typed factory and shared readonly operations tables remain the runtime "
"interface; no new registry, worker, allocator, lock or product configuration"
" authority is introduced."
msgstr ""
"Nexus 维护精确芯片机制。SoC 事实和路由、私有 provider、生成的静态实例、Board 接线与实际物理行为分别承担责任。运行时仍使用现有 "
"typed factory 和共享只读操作表，不引入新的 registry、worker、allocator、lock 或产品配置权威。"

msgid ""
"The {download}`55-item execution ledger <soc-refinement-execution.csv>` "
"separates existing correction and optimization (SOC-01–27), conditional "
"target extensions (SOC-28–36), and physical acceptance (SOC-37–55). Codex "
"owns all maintenance. Implementation status, executed software evidence and "
"physical status are recorded independently. An authored plan, a synthetic "
"parser test or an ARM link cannot complete a physical exit condition."
msgstr ""
"{download}`55 项执行台账 <soc-refinement-"
"execution.csv>`区分现有修正优化（SOC-01–27）、有条件目标扩展（SOC-28–36）和物理验收（SOC-37–55）。全部维护由 "
"Codex 负责。实现状态、实际软件证据和物理状态分别记录。编写计划、synthetic parser 测试或 ARM 链接均不能完成物理退出条件。"

msgid "Current software boundaries"
msgstr "当前软件边界"

msgid ""
"STM32F407VET6/ZGT6 and GD32F470ZGT6 maintain reviewed fixed clock, startup, "
"monotonic timer and selected controller modes. The [derived capability "
"matrix](../delivery/capabilities.md) enumerates exact facts, routes, "
"selected production sources and software fixtures. Exact F103RB/GD303RC "
"references add legacy channel-DMA UART, IRQ-message I2C and physical Flash, "
"single-shot ADC and fixed PWM. G474 adds selected bulb ADC shots/finite TIM6"
" DMA, polling I2C and ECC Flash to its GPIO/UART/SPI/PWM/EXTI/watchdog "
"baseline. The non-M4 references are STM32H743ZIT6 and STM32U575ZIT6Q. H743 "
"maintains fixed clock/cache profiles, finite UART DMA TX or RX-IDLE, "
"optional initialized D2 SRAM1 and selected finite peripherals. U575 keeps "
"its TZEN0 finite peripherals separate from an independent copied GPIO dual-"
"world reference. CPU ABI/runtime support for other Cortex-M profiles does "
"not imply a full SoC, Board or peripheral implementation."
msgstr ""
"STM32F407VET6/ZGT6 与 GD32F470ZGT6 "
"维护经审查的固定时钟、启动、单调计时器和所选控制器模式。[派生能力矩阵](../delivery/capabilities.md)列出精确事实、路线、所选生产源码和软件夹具。精确"
" F103RB/GD303RC 参考增加 legacy channel-DMA UART、IRQ 消息 I2C、物理 Flash、单次 ADC 和固定 "
"PWM。G474 在 GPIO/UART/SPI/PWM/EXTI/watchdog 基线上增加所选 bulb ADC 单次／有限 TIM6 "
"DMA、轮询 I2C 与 ECC Flash。非 M4 参考是 STM32H743ZIT6 和 STM32U575ZIT6Q。H743 维护固定 "
"clock/cache、有限 UART DMA TX 或 RX-IDLE、可选已初始化 D2 SRAM1 和所选有限外设。U575 的 TZEN0 "
"有限外设与独立的复制 GPIO 双域参考保持分开。其他 Cortex-M 的 CPU ABI/runtime 支持不代表完整 SoC、Board "
"或外设实现。"

