msgstr "option-byte 修改、DMA、其他 RAM 放置和运行态交接；TZEN0 装配没有 TrustZone transport"

msgid "U575, separate dual-world reference"
msgstr "U575 独立双域参考"

msgid ""
"TZEN1 cold attribution owner, Secure/NS Runtime, real CMSE; scalar GPIO and "
"cooperative jobs of up to eight copied PC7 commands in one Secure slot"
msgstr ""
"TZEN1 冷归属 owner、Secure/NS Runtime、真实 CMSE；scalar GPIO，以及最多八个 PC7 命令复制到单一 "
"Secure slot 的 cooperative job"

msgid ""
"General dual-world factory, NS RTOS/task identities, retained NS pointers or"
" asynchronous loans, cross-domain DMA, loader authentication and physical "
"isolation qualification"
msgstr "通用双域 factory、NS RTOS／任务身份、保留 NS 指针或异步借用、跨域 DMA、loader 认证和物理隔离资格"

msgid ""
"These are source-reviewed Board references. Their physical PCB revisions, "
"silicon revisions, solder bridges, electrical connections and option bytes "
"have not been observed. Reference-only HIL admission fails closed; selecting"
" a matching chip name cannot promote a reference into a qualified physical "
"Board. The [extension execution record](../delivery/soc-extensions-"
"verification.md) distinguishes normal commit gates, development ARM "
"observations and final qualification. The [earlier "
"baseline](../delivery/soc-refinement-verification.md) retains its original "
"source identity and evidence. Reference software status in the ledger "
"records bounded host/ARM evidence; it does not establish a clean candidate, "
"physical acceptance or every original exit condition."
msgstr ""
"这些是来源已复核的 Board 参考；实际 PCB/silicon revision、焊桥、电气连接与 option bytes "
"尚未观测。reference-only HIL admission "
"默认拒绝，匹配芯片名称不能使参考成为合格实板。[扩展执行记录](../delivery/soc-extensions-"
"verification.md)区分普通 commit gate、开发 ARM 观测与最终资格。[原始基线](../delivery/soc-"
"refinement-verification.md)保留原 source identity 和证据。台账中的参考软件状态仅建立有界 host/ARM "
"证据，不建立 clean candidate、物理验收或全部原始退出条件。"

msgid ""
"The [G474 contract](stm32g474.md) describes independent EXTI0/PA0 and "
"EXTI1/PA1 rings, pending-bit acknowledgement, mux/gate ownership and source "
"withdrawal. Its test Board is an explicit software fixture, with no inferred"
" connector, button or electrical bias. The [H743 "
"contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md) defines all four HSI 32/64 MHz and Cache "
"off/on combinations. Fixed cold profile selection does not implement a "
"running frequency transition."
msgstr ""
"[G474 合同](stm32g474.md)定义独立 EXTI0/PA0 和 EXTI1/PA1 ring、pending ACK、mux/gate "
"ownership 和源撤离。测试 Board 是显式软件 fixture，不推测连接器、按钮或电气偏置。[H743 "
"合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md)定义 HSI 32/64 MHz 与 Cache 关/开的四种组合。固定 cold "
"profile 选择不实现运行中频率切换。"

msgid ""
"H743 USART3 DMA TX owns DMA1 Stream0, DMAMUX1 Channel0 request46 and its "
"separate vector; the alternative RX-IDLE selection owns DMA1 "
"Stream1/channel1 request45 and keeps TX IRQ-driven. Finite RX needs owner "
"service and rearm gaps; it is not continuous or implicit duplex. Cache-on "
"buffers occupy exclusively owned complete 32-byte lines in selected "
"initialized AXI/SRAM1, with no outward rounding or hidden bounce buffer. "
"Cache cleaning follows borrow admission, runs outside the long interrupt "
"mask, and cannot settle storage while preparation is active. DMA completion,"
" wire TC and source withdrawal remain distinct. Failed withdrawal "
"quarantines the loan; the provider must drain before cache and timer "
"shutdown."
msgstr ""
"H743 USART3 DMA TX 拥有 DMA1 Stream0、DMAMUX1 Channel0 request46 和独立向量；替代的 RX-"
"IDLE 选择拥有 DMA1 Stream1/channel1 request45，TX 保持 IRQ 推进。有限 RX 需要 owner "
"service 且有 rearm 间隙，不是连续或隐式 duplex。Cache-on 缓冲区占有所选已初始化 AXI/SRAM1 内独占的完整 "
"32-byte lines，不向外扩展对齐，也没有隐藏 bounce buffer。借用准入后才 clean，操作不置于长中断屏蔽区，准备仍在进行时不能"
" settle 存储。DMA 完成、真实 wire TC 和源撤回分别证明。撤回失败将 loan 隔离；provider 必须排空后才能停止 cache"
" 与 timer。"

msgid ""
"The [U575 dual-world contract](u575-trustzone-contract.md) is an independent"
" no-OS integration fixture. Its cold owner observes provisioned option "
"bytes, checks actual physical permissions, clears future shared RAM, then "
"configures and seals attribution. A real SG gateway authenticates the NS "
"world rather than an untrusted task identity, checks CMSE permissions and "
"copies a bounded request through the existing GPIO broker. The layout and "
"GPIO grant belong to the reference fixture, not to reusable platform policy."
" A separate copied job entry admits up to eight PC7 commands into one Secure"
" slot, advances one command per SERVICE and uses nonwrapping tickets; no NS "
"pointer survives return. No option-byte programming, RTOS isolation, general"
" factory integration or asynchronous transport is claimed."
msgstr ""
"[U575 双域合同](u575-trustzone-contract.md)是独立无 OS 集成夹具。冷 owner 观察已配置的 option "
"bytes、检查真实物理权限、清除未来共享 RAM，再配置并封存归属。真实 SG gateway 认证 NS world 而非不可信任务身份，检查 "
"CMSE 权限，并通过既有 GPIO broker 复制有界请求。布局和 GPIO grant 属于参考夹具，不是通用平台政策。独立的复制 job "
"入口将最多八条 PC7 命令准入单一 Secure slot，每次 SERVICE 推进一条，并使用不回绕 ticket；返回后不保留 NS "
"指针。不承诺 option-byte 编程、RTOS 隔离、通用 factory 集成或异步 transport。"

msgid ""
"Clock bootstrap uses finite poll work bounds before the final clock exists; "
"polls are not measured elapsed milliseconds. Cleanup must distinguish "
"remaining recovery obligations from conservative settings allowed to remain."
" The monotonic timer belongs to one successfully started boot domain. The "
"32-bit references and GD303 hardware cascade require high-overflow service "
"within 2^32 nominal microseconds; F103's 16-bit TIM2 requires 65.536 ms. Old"
" deadlines cannot be carried across stop/restart. NMI/HardFault, paused "
"timers, dynamic PLL changes and deep STOP require their own exact contract "
"rather than assumptions from ordinary task execution."
msgstr ""
"最终时钟建立前，bootstrap 采用有限 polling 工作上界；poll "
"次数不是实测经过的毫秒。清理必须区分剩余恢复责任和允许保留的保守配置。单调计时器属于一次成功启动的 boot domain。32-bit 参考与 "
"GD303 硬件级联要求在 2^32 名义微秒内服务 high overflow；F103 的 16-bit TIM2 要求 65.536 "
"ms。停止／重启后不能继续使用旧 deadline。NMI/HardFault、暂停的 timer、动态 PLL 和 deep STOP "
"需要独立精确合同，不能套用普通 task 假设。"

msgid ""
"Cold admission rejects observable foreign selected owners before global "
"clock mutation. Generated pin admission observes all required GPIO gates and"
" validates all selected pin modes and locks before capturing or changing any"
" pin. This includes controller routes and hidden endpoint CS pins; an "
"unrelated shared-bank pin does not become owned. An initialization failure "
"includes its partially initialized object in reverse cleanup. Failed "
"readback preserves exactly the remaining cleanup responsibility instead of "
"returning a successful release."
msgstr ""
"Cold admission 在全局时钟变化前拒绝可观察的外来 selected owner。生成的 pin admission 观察所需 GPIO "
"gate，并在捕获/修改任意 pin 前验证全部选定 pin mode/lock，包括控制器 route 和隐藏 endpoint CS。共享 bank"
" 中无关 pin 不因此成为自有。初始化失败将部分初始化对象纳入逆序 cleanup；readback 失败保留准确剩余责任，不返回成功释放。"

msgid ""
"The timer start transaction clears stale UIF, observes a fresh UG update, "
"clears that flag and verifies CNT before publishing the epoch. Runtime "
"overflow advances the epoch only after acknowledged UIF. A refused ACK "
"invalidates public time, records the private timer fault and attempts finite"
" source/clocked-counter/NVIC withdrawal. This loss of the deadline domain is"
" always terminal, including successful source isolation: the CPU preserves a"
" terminal interrupt mask, invokes the existing bounded fault observer and "
"parks if that observer returns. No invalid zero timestamp resumes a deadline"
" consumer, and no request or low-power loan is released. Products may "
"provide separately reviewed non-returning recovery. Ordinary stop/restart "
"and cleanup retry belong to normal lifecycle control; they do not resume "
"this terminal path. A snapshot rechecks epoch validity under the same saved "
"interrupt mask used to read both counter words."
msgstr ""
"Timer start transaction 清除 stale UIF，观察新 UG update，清除标志并确认 CNT 后才发布 "
"epoch。运行期 overflow 只在 UIF ACK 成功后推进 epoch。ACK 被拒绝时使公共时间失效，记录私有故障并尝试有限 "
"source/clocked-counter/NVIC 撤离。Deadline domain 丢失始终是 terminal，即使隔离成功：CPU 保持 "
"terminal interrupt mask，调用有界 fault observer，observer 返回则停驻。无效零 timestamp "
"不能恢复 deadline consumer，request/低功耗 loan 不释放。产品可以提供另经审查的不返回恢复。普通 stop/restart"
" 或 cleanup retry 不恢复此 terminal 路径。Snapshot 在读取两段 counter 的同一 saved mask 下复查 "
"epoch validity。"

msgid ""
"`.noinit` means startup neither copies nor clears those bytes. It does not "
"prove retention through a particular reset, power event or sleep mode. CPU "
"reachability, DMA reachability, linker placement and physical retention are "
"separate facts. Factory access does not initialize or reacquire any of these"
" resources."
msgstr ""
"`.noinit` 表示 startup 既不复制也不清零这些字节，不证明特定 reset、供电事件或 sleep 下的 retention。CPU "
"可达、DMA 可达、linker placement 和物理 retention 分别是独立事实。Factory 访问不初始化或重新取得任何资源。"

msgid ""
"IRQ and DMA routines have finite work contracts. The selected execution "
"owner must continue required service/cancel/drain progress. DMA completion, "
"wire completion and withdrawal of every request reference precede SETTLED. "
"Failed withdrawal retains QUARANTINED storage; cancellation is not "
"permission to reclaim it. Continuous block providers stop on exhausted "
"replacement storage and never write consumer-owned blocks or invent exact "
"missed-event counts."
msgstr ""
"IRQ 与 DMA 例程具有有限工作量合同。选定执行 owner 必须持续推进所需 service/cancel/drain。DMA "
"完成、线侧完成和全部请求引用撤离均先于 SETTLED。撤离失败时保留 QUARANTINED "
"存储；取消不授予回收许可。连续块提供者在替换存储耗尽时停止，绝不写入消费者拥有的块，也不编造精确的漏事件数量。"

msgid ""
"Public typed I/O contracts belong under `io/include`; cross-chip controller "
"algorithms have private headers and implementation targets. SoC wrappers own"
" silicon layout/bit assertions and physical IRQ/DMA/clock bindings. Shared "
"code placement follows those dependencies. CMake owns source selection, and "
"resolver facts own configuration identity; moving a file does not create a "
"second graph."
msgstr ""
"公共 typed I/O 合同归 `io/include`；跨芯片 controller algorithm 使用私有头和实现 target。SoC "
"wrapper 拥有 silicon layout/bit assertion 与实际 IRQ/DMA/clock "
"binding，共享源码位置由这些依赖决定。CMake 拥有源码选择，resolver facts 拥有配置身份；移动文件不创建第二张依赖图。"

msgid "Implemented correction and optimization"
msgstr "已实现的修正与优化"

msgid ""
"SOC-01–27 retain their original exit conditions. The following groups "
"identify the implementation, without extending a software result to physical"
" behavior. Per-item status and evidence entry points remain in the CSV."
msgstr "SOC-01–27 保留原始退出条件。下面按组定位实现，不把软件结果扩大为物理行为。逐项状态和证据入口仍在 CSV。"

msgid "Items"
msgstr "条目"

msgid "Mechanism and review boundary"
msgstr "机制与审查边界"

msgid "01–05"
msgstr "01–05"

msgid ""
"Current scope documentation, derived capability consistency, exact-package "
"GPIO inventory, configuration input closure and versioned primary "
"source/errata index. The source index is not a complete silicon-revision "
"workaround qualification."
msgstr ""
"当前范围文档、派生能力一致性、精确封装 GPIO inventory、配置输入闭包和版本化 primary source/errata "
"index。资料索引不等于完整 silicon-revision workaround 资格。"

msgid "06–07"
msgstr "06–07"

msgid ""
"Immutable controller and family descriptors unify configuration identities, "
"provider dispatch and required SDK payload. CMake still exclusively owns "
"production source dependencies."
msgstr ""
"不可变 controller/family descriptor 统一配置身份、provider dispatch 和必需 SDK "
"payload；CMake 仍独占生产源码依赖。"

msgid "08–16"
msgstr "08–16"

msgid ""
"Explicit pre-RAM/post-RAM ownership, foreign-owner rejection, bounded clock "
"transactions and rollback, observed timer start/ACK, context restrictions "
"and boot-domain validity."
msgstr ""
"显式 pre-RAM/post-RAM ownership、foreign-owner 拒绝、有界 clock "
"transaction/rollback、timer start/ACK 观测、context 限制与 boot-domain validity。"

msgid "17–19"
msgstr "17–19"

msgid ""
"Fixed-profile shallow Sleep/tickless contracts, shared USB48 ownership and "
"`.noinit` semantics; no implicit deep-STOP or retention guarantee."
msgstr ""
"固定 profile shallow Sleep/tickless、共享 USB48 ownership 和 `.noinit` 语义；无隐式深 "
"STOP/retention 承诺。"

msgid "20–22"
msgstr "20–22"

msgid ""
"G474 UART comparison wrap and one-byte masked reads, selected-line GD EXTI "
"dispatch, observed EXTI withdrawal and documented IRQ/service/drain work."
msgstr ""
"G474 UART 比较回绕和单字节 masked read、选定 GD EXTI line dispatch、实际 EXTI 撤离及 "
"IRQ/service/drain 工作说明。"

msgid "23, 27"
msgstr "23, 27"

msgid ""
"Real ELF/disassembly observation, tool/input receipts and strict comparable-"
"profile cost review. Flash, static RAM, reserved stack and caller storage "
"are distinct quantities; instruction counts are not measured cycles."
msgstr ""
"真实 ELF/disassembly 观测、工具/输入 receipt 和严格同 profile 成本比较。Flash、静态 RAM、保留 stack "
"和 caller storage 分开；指令数不是实测 cycles。"

msgid "24–25"
msgstr "24–25"

msgid ""
"Explicit F407 CCM placement and GD RAM initializer validation. All "
"copy/clear spans are validated before the first write; unselected domains "
"cost no default storage and `.noinit` remains untouched."
msgstr ""
"显式 F407 CCM 放置与 GD RAM initializer 校验。首次写入前验证全部 copy/clear "
"span；未选域无默认成本，`.noinit` 不受修改。"

msgid "26"
msgstr "26"

msgid ""
"Public I/O, private cross-chip controller algorithms and SoC SDK assertions "
"retain their dependency boundaries. No forwarding-only runtime layer or "
"generic mutable registry is added."
msgstr ""
"公共 I/O、私有跨芯片算法与 SoC SDK assertion 保持依赖边界；不增加纯转发 runtime 层或通用可变 registry。"

msgid ""
"F407 CCM is CPU-only and rejected as a DMA buffer. H743 memory facts "
"describe DMA1/DMA2, BDMA and MDMA separately. The implemented finite USART3 "
"DMA1 TX/RX lanes admit selected, initialized AXI SRAM or explicitly budgeted"
" D2 SRAM1; unselected domains, TCM and an unready SRAM1 gate are rejected. "
"MDMA reachability to TCM does not authorize a driver, cache protocol or "
"linker placement. U575 GPDMA/LPDMA facts do not implement linked-list "
"engines or security-crossing DMA. Its synchronous CPU gateway does not "
"authorize DMA buffers or asynchronous storage loans. Legacy `dma` facts and "
"explicit `dma_engines` are alternative authored forms; contradictory inputs "
"are rejected rather than repaired."
msgstr ""
"F407 CCM 仅 CPU 可达，作为 DMA 缓冲区时被拒绝。H743 内存事实分别描述 DMA1/DMA2、BDMA 和 MDMA。已实现的有限 "
"USART3 DMA1 TX/RX 路径接纳选中且已初始化的 AXI SRAM 或显式预算的 D2 SRAM1；未选中的域、TCM 与未就绪的 "
"SRAM1 gate 均被拒绝。MDMA 可达 TCM 不授予驱动、缓存协议或链接放置授权。U575 GPDMA/LPDMA "
"事实不实现链表引擎或跨安全域 DMA；其同步 CPU 网关不授权 DMA 缓冲区或异步存储借用。旧 `dma` 事实与显式 `dma_engines` "
"是二选一的编写形式；矛盾输入直接拒绝，不自动修复。"

msgid ""
"SDK identity includes reviewed original CMSIS Device files, their licenses, "
"upstream revisions and the selected family payload. Verification checks "
"bytes, file sets and observed filesystem identity across its read window. A "
"successful check is not an atomic filesystem snapshot; actual consumers must"
" use the same immutable SDK. Independent installed consumers must exercise "
"the public platform interface without inheriting private vendor include "
"paths."
msgstr ""
"SDK 身份包含复核过的原始 CMSIS Device 文件、许可、上游 revision 和选定 family payload。验证在读取窗口内检查 "
"bytes、文件集合与 filesystem identity，但不建立原子 filesystem snapshot；真实 consumer "
"必须使用同一 immutable SDK。独立 installed consumer 使用公共平台接口，不能继承私有 vendor include "
"路径。"

msgid ""
"Hot-path observations retain actual ELF bytes, resolved selection, compile "
"flags, tool identities, resources and complete command receipts. A changed "
"Board route, CPU/ABI, backend, clock, memory domain or capacity makes a "
"regression comparison incomparable. Empty-to-selected image growth is "
"reported as a selection cost, not as an equivalent-profile performance "
"improvement. Physical cycles, maximum interrupt blackout and worst-case "
"service intervals remain unmeasured."
msgstr ""
"Hot-path 观测保留实际 ELF bytes、resolved selection、flags、工具身份、资源及完整命令 "
"receipt。Board route、CPU/ABI、backend、clock、memory domain 或 capacity "
"改变时，回归比较不可比。Empty-to-selected 镜像增长是 selection cost，不是相同 profile 性能改善。物理 "
"cycles、最大 IRQ blackout 和最坏 service 间隔仍未测量。"

msgid "Physical preparation and execution"
msgstr "物理准备与执行"

msgid ""
"`tools/hil/soc_acceptance.py plan` prepares all nineteen physical "
"obligations without touching equipment. Each case contains required "
"hardware, stimulation, raw observations, assertions, safety actions, metric "
"units, unreviewed null limits and an exit condition. Selection gaps and "
"unsupported OS cases remain explicit. The result is always "
"`prepared_unbound` / `not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"`tools/hil/soc_acceptance.py plan` 不操作设备即可准备十九项物理义务。每项包含所需硬件、激励、raw "
"observation、assertion、安全动作、metric unit、未审查的 null limit 和退出条件。Selection "
"gap/unsupported OS case 保持明确；结果始终为 `prepared_unbound` / `not_executed`。"

msgid ""
"A real station supplies observed PCB revision, part/UID, probe, supply, "
"wiring, exact ELF, resolved configuration, recomputed resources and reviewed"
" workload. Existing `admit.py` establishes that admission. A station-"
"authored SoC protocol binds one case, selected controller IDs, required "
"instruments/calibration bytes, stimulation and numeric limits. Invariant "
"failure counts must remain exactly zero; actual work counts/durations "
"require a positive reviewed lower bound. Nothing in the repository supplies "
"product acceptance numbers or fabricates pin wiring."
msgstr ""
"真实 station 提供实测 PCB 修订、料号／UID、探针、供电、接线、精确 ELF、已解析配置、重算资源和已审查负载，由现有 "
"`admit.py` 建立准入。站点编写的 SoC 协议绑定一个用例、选定控制器 "
"ID、所需仪器／校准字节、激励与数值限制。不变量失败计数必须严格为零；实际工作量和耗时必须具有已审查的正数下限。仓库不提供产品验收数值，也不虚构引脚接线。"

msgid ""
"`capture` delegates to the maintained acquisition runner. The existing six "
"operations retain exact tool/input identities, exclusive station ownership, "
"whole-argument argv without a shell, timeout/output bounds, cleanup and "
"quarantine. The serial/instrument adapter must receive and content-pin the "
"SoC protocol and all instrument records. This runner does not implement "
"automatic waveform, CAN/USB/Ethernet peers or power interruption; station-"
"owned adapters provide those operations. A successful capture is only "
"`executed_unqualified`."
msgstr ""
"`capture` 委托维护中的采集执行器。既有六种操作保留精确工具／输入身份、站点独占、无 shell 的完整 "
"argv、超时／输出上限、清理和隔离责任。串口／仪器适配器必须接收并按内容锁定 SoC "
"协议及全部仪器记录。此执行器不实现自动波形采集、CAN/USB/Ethernet 对端或断电；这些操作由站点适配器提供。成功采集也仅为 "
"`executed_unqualified`。"

msgid ""
"`validate` rebuilds unchanged admission and recipe, verifies actual "
"operation records, protocol, instrument bytes, session, "
"firmware/configuration, acquisition context, raw observations and sample "
"files. It derives every result from finite, contiguous nonempty samples "
"against the reviewed limits. Rehashed opaque protocols, null limits, "
"missing/failed/skipped operations, stale records, changed bytes and wrong "
"scopes fail closed. A result qualifies only the named case, selected modes "
"and recorded conditions; it does not establish WCET, unobserved loads, "
"certification or product release."
msgstr ""
"`validate` 重建未变的 admission/recipe，校验实际 operation、protocol、instrument "
"bytes、session、firmware/configuration、采集 context、raw observation 与 sample "
"files。对有限、连续、非空 sample 按已审 limits 派生结果。重新hash的opaque protocol、null "
"limit、缺失/失败/跳过操作、陈旧记录、字节漂移和错误scope均拒绝。结果仅资格化命名case、selected "
"mode和记录条件，不建立WCET、未观察负载、认证或产品发布。"

msgid ""
"Flash power-loss cases additionally require a content-pinned external "
"product layout. The test region must use the exact part's erase boundaries, "
"remain within physical Flash, avoid every protected region and avoid all "
"actual firmware LOAD bytes. The external layout must protect every admitted "
"firmware LOAD. Products own the region, protected data, power-cut safety and"
" recovery policy. The platform reserves no default test partition and "
"performs no destructive action during preparation, validation or commit "
"checks."
msgstr ""
"Flash 断电用例还需要按内容锁定的外部产品布局。测试区域必须使用精确料号的擦除边界，位于物理 Flash 内，避开全部受保护区域和实际固件 LOAD"
" 字节。外部布局必须保护全部已准入固件 LOAD。区域、受保护数据、断电安全和恢复策略由产品拥有。平台不预留默认测试分区；准备、验证和 commit "
"检查均不执行破坏性操作。"

msgid "Extension decisions"
msgstr "扩展决定"

msgid ""
"SOC-28–36 keep their original exit conditions. Choosing H743 and U575 "
"resolves the first non-M4 target decision; it does not complete every "
"conditional feature."
msgstr ""
"SOC-28–36 保留原始退出条件。选择 H743/U575 解决首批非 M4 目标决策，不完成全部conditional feature。"

msgid "Item"
msgstr "条目"

msgid "Delivered subset or remaining implementation"
msgstr "已交付子集或待实现范围"

msgid "28"
msgstr "28"

msgid ""
"H743 HSI 32/64 MHz with Cache off/on, plus the U575 MSIS 4 MHz reference. "
"Other oscillator/PLL/supply profiles and electrical qualification remain "
"outside the implemented subset."
msgstr ""
"H743 HSI 32/64 MHz、Cache 关/开及 U575 MSIS 4 MHz 参考。其他oscillator/PLL/supply "
"profile和电气资格不在已实现子集。"

msgid "29"
msgstr "29"

msgid ""
"G474 baseline plus selected bulb ADC shots/finite TIM6 DMA, polling I2C and "
"ECC Flash, generated ownership and fixtures. Unselected modes, exact final-"
"source qualification and physical timing/analog acceptance remain separate."
msgstr ""
"G474 基线加所选 bulb ADC 单次／有限 TIM6 DMA、轮询 I2C、ECC "
"Flash、生成所有权和夹具。未选模式、最终精确源码资格和物理时序／模拟验收分别记录。"

msgid "30"
msgstr "30"

msgid ""
"Exact H743ZI/U575ZIQ/G474RE inventories and selected new finite peripheral "
"routes. Other packages/controllers/routes need their own facts, ownership, "
"models and budgets; actual Board wiring remains unobserved."
msgstr ""
"精确 H743ZI/U575ZIQ/G474RE 清单及新增有限外设路线。其他封装／控制器／路线仍需独立事实、所有权、模型与预算；实际 Board "
"接线未观察。"

msgid "31"
msgstr "31"

msgid ""
"Selected H743/U575 startup/time, GPIO/UART and finite "
"SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/watchdog/Flash references. A complete peripheral set, "
"every OS mode and actual MCU execution are not established."
msgstr ""
"所选 H743/U575 启动／时间、GPIO/UART 与有限 SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/watchdog/Flash "
"参考。不建立完整外设集、所有 OS 模式或真实 MCU 执行资格。"

msgid "32"
msgstr "32"

msgid ""
"H743 fixed cache ownership, finite USART3 DMA1 TX or RX-IDLE and explicitly "
"initialized AXI/SRAM1, plus U575 CPU attribution mechanisms. Continuous RX, "
"other H7 engines, U5 DMA and security-crossing DMA remain unimplemented; "
"physical coherency is unverified."
msgstr ""
"H743 固定 cache 所有权、有限 USART3 DMA1 TX 或 RX-IDLE、显式初始化 AXI/SRAM1，以及 U575 CPU "
"归属机制。连续 RX、其他 H7 引擎、U5 DMA 和跨安全域 DMA 仍未实现；物理一致性未验证。"

msgid "33"
msgstr "33"

msgid ""
"Not implemented. Unknown running state is rejected; bootloader-to-platform "
"clock, IRQ, DMA, cache, RAM and live-owner handoff is absent. The U575 cold "
"world transition does not implement this feature."
msgstr ""
"未实现。拒绝unknown running "
"state；缺少bootloader→platform的clock、IRQ、DMA、cache、RAM与live-owner handoff。U575 "
"cold world transition不实现此功能。"

msgid "34"
msgstr "34"

msgid ""
"Not implemented. H743's four profiles are cold configurations, with no "
"running frequency transition, consumer reclocking or deadline-domain "
"conversion."
msgstr ""
"未实现。H743四种profile是cold配置，无running frequency transition、consumer "
"reclocking或deadline-domain conversion。"

msgid "35"
msgstr "35"

msgid ""
"Not implemented. Existing F407/F470 shallow Sleep does not supply a deep-"
"STOP continuous RTC/LPTIM domain, retention proof or wake restoration."
msgstr ""
"未实现。F407/F470 shallow Sleep不提供deep-STOP continuous RTC/LPTIM "
"domain、retention proof或wake restoration。"

msgid "36"
msgstr "36"

msgid ""
"Partial synchronous U575 reference only: Secure/NS images, cold attribution "
"owner, single unprivileged NS Thread and copied GPIO gateway. No dual-world "
"platform factory, NS RTOS, multitask identity, mutable address space, "
"asynchronous borrow/drain or HIL isolation qualification."
msgstr ""
"仅部分同步U575参考：Secure/NS镜像、cold attribution owner、单一非特权NS Thread、复制GPIO "
"gateway。无双域platform factory、NS RTOS、多任务identity、mutable address "
"space、异步borrow/drain或HIL isolation资格。"

msgid ""
"Implementing rejection of an unsupported configuration is a valid defensive "
"contract; it is not implementation of the rejected feature. Additional "
"features need exact controller/mode ownership and acceptance evidence before"
" these ledger entries can close. Current first-release devices retain their "
"declared fixed profiles."
msgstr ""
"拒绝unsupported配置是有效防御合同，但不等于实现被拒feature。关闭台账前，新feature需要精确controller/mode "
"ownership和验收证据。首发芯片保留已声明fixed profiles。"

msgid ""
"The remaining software work for SOC-33–35 requires coordinated ownership "
"rather than another profile label. Running-state handoff needs an exact "
"outgoing and incoming image/resource contract, validated "
"stack/vector/FP/IRQ/cache/RAM state, and a reviewed terminal transfer. "
"External products retain loader authentication, partition and recovery "
"policy. Dynamic frequency changes need actual consumer quiescence, ordered "
"electrical changes, bounded rollback, OS timing adaptation and an explicit "
"continuous time contract. Deep STOP additionally needs an exact RTC/LPTIM "
"reference, wake/retention admission, elapsed-time reconstruction and "
"consumer restoration; ordinary shallow-sleep preparation does not establish "
"it."
msgstr ""
"SOC-33–35 剩余软件需要协同ownership，不是再加profile名。运行态handoff需要精确outgoing/incoming "
"image/resource合同、已验证stack/vector/FP/IRQ/cache/RAM状态和受审terminal "
"transfer。外部产品仍拥有loader authentication、partition和recovery。动态调频需要consumer "
"quiescence、有序电气变化、有界rollback、OS timing adaptation和明确continuous time。Deep "
"STOP额外需要精确RTC/LPTIM参考、wake/retention admission、elapsed-time "
"reconstruction和consumer restoration；普通shallow准备不能建立这些能力。"

msgid ""
"SOC-36 still needs a separately reviewed dual-world configuration/factory "
"path, trusted OS task identity and mutable-map/copy-fault contracts before "
"general userspace support. Async and DMA extensions must preserve borrow, "
"cancel, drain and final-publication rules across the security boundary. "
"These are additional mechanisms, not consequences of the current synchronous"
" GPIO reference."
msgstr ""
"SOC-36 要形成通用userspace支持，仍需独立审查的双域configuration/factory、可信OS task "
"identity及mutable-map/copy-"
"fault合同。Async/DMA扩展必须跨安全边界保留borrow/cancel/drain/final-"
"publication规则；这些是新机制，不由当前同步GPIO参考自动产生。"

msgid ""
"Physical equipment is currently disconnected. SOC-37–55 have executable "
"tooling and station-binding obligations; their physical exit status remains "
"`not_executed`. See [HIL authoring and commands](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/hil/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"当前设备未连接。SOC-37–55 有可执行工装和station绑定义务，物理退出状态仍为 "
"`not_executed`。见[HIL编写与命令](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/hil/README.md)。"
